],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.5357,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Parent epic c4c8 Decomposition: '3. beaming-snively-urial - rank aggregation (aggregate.py) by priority instead of severity.'","Leaf CORRECTION: 'aggregate.py::aggregate_findings ... is confirmed DEAD CODE ... aggregate.py needs no change in this epic.'","Leaf Approach: 'Thread priority AND decision through code_review/shim.py's _to_common_finding ...'","Dead-code claim corroborated: search_files shows aggregate_findings referenced only at aggregate.py:76 (def) and llm/__init__.py:36,100 (re-export) — no live src/rebar/ call site.","shim.py is within the epic's declared dep surface (parent manifest 'dep 66fd6838... src/rebar/llm/code_review/shim.py'), so the leaf is not reaching into an unowned file.","Grade rationale: parent GOAL ('every finding carries priority + decision') is advanced, not contradicted; only the parent's named MECHANISM (aggregate.py) is superseded — incomplete_enumeration, coached."],"finding":"The leaf redefines the parent epic's Decomposition item 3 deliverable — the parent names 'rank aggregation (aggregate.py) by priority instead of severity' as this ticket's work, but the leaf declares aggregate.py dead code (out of scope, zero diff) and instead threads priority/decision through shim.py::_to_common_finding. The substitution is well-grounded and still advances the epic's AC that every finding carry priority+decision, but it supersedes the parent's named mechanism without the parent plan having been updated to match.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f2fd13047e9d674d0","impact":0.44,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan 'Problem'/'Approach' vs parent epic c4c8 Decomposition item 3","norm_id":"n7276fb817e10b9db","priority":0.3143,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A reviewer reading the epic's item-3 wording expects an aggregate.py diff on this ticket and finds none, unless the epic plan is updated to reflect the corrected mechanism."],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"Amend the parent epic's Decomposition item 3 to read approximately: 'beaming-snively-urial — thread priority/decision onto review_result findings via shim.py::_to_common_finding (aggregate.py is confirmed dead code, no change).' Then the leaf is a faithful subset of the corrected parent.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.7143,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"incomplete_enumeration","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.7,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Define the emitted `decision` value vocabulary on the common finding (e.g. {block, advisory} for shim-reachable findings) and state whether dropped/indeterminate can ever appear, ideally as a schema enum $def.","cohort":["T8"],"criteria":["T8"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.502,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["decide.py returns decision ∈ {indeterminate, dropped, block, advisory} (lines 668/685/701/719/735)","Only blocking[]/advisory[] findings enter _to_common_finding (shim.py:88), so dropped/indeterminate should never appear — but the plan does not state this","search of src/rebar/schemas for 'decision' finds no enum $def"],"finding":"The plan threads a `decision` field through _to_common_finding but never defines its value vocabulary. The kernel decide.py emits {indeterminate, dropped, block, advisory}, yet only block/advisory findings reach the shim; the plan does not state which values can appear on the emitted finding, and `decision` is not defined as an enum anywhere under schemas/.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fc6eea9be7d4e09ed","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach ('Thread `priority` AND `decision`'); AC line 1","norm_id":"n0d057d83151ef161","priority":0.198,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A consumer branches on finding.decision and encounters an undocumented/unexpected value","A DET-tier finding backfilled by the sibling ticket carries a `decision` value the shim consumer does not anticipate"],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.75,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"low"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Name the current review_result/review_code() consumer of the threaded `decision` field, or s